--- !u!114 &1202550938
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1202550934}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ca497f0c2d7d7cd4b89188f336049d41, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneController
  imagemFundo: {fileID: 813380205}
  imagemPersonagemUI: {fileID: 1489011120}
  textoNomePersonagem: {fileID: 1583282777}
  textoBalao: {fileID: 1413458684}
  canvasGroupFade: {fileID: 2070692054}
  audioSourceSFX: {fileID: 1202550937}
  duracaoFade: 0.5
  velocidadeEscrita: 0.07
  nomeProximaCena: Fase1
  listaPersonagens:
  - nome: Myke
    bocaFechada: {fileID: -7315111759967458589, guid: 2df5173a1c14c9d46a6346d3ebd596e1, type: 3}
    bocaAberta: {fileID: -4517367349893309993, guid: 86cd7d756088f5e4a9537600ae66164b, type: 3}
  - nome: "P\xE9res"
    bocaFechada: {fileID: 5600772223580213204, guid: 25aa12e0e475b494b944857e6d5d4913, type: 3}
    bocaAberta: {fileID: 7517225429614508252, guid: 4e4e79b3fe84c5c4e984a15d1c049ede, type: 3}
  - nome: Narrator
    bocaFechada: {fileID: 1143495456257030561, guid: dfec08b89706de549b31598b22ab34cd, type: 3}
    bocaAberta: {fileID: -2472076170658201133, guid: 52bcc9e4e52056b4e96663edca6c3537, type: 3}
  falas:
  - nomeQuemFala: Narrator
    texto: "Myke and P\xE9res used to be an unbeatable team, sharing the same lab
      and the same big dreams."
    imagemFundo: {fileID: 4085662441678637604, guid: 20575267bdc4a6d48a4290360b76d2ee, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e1e8e5ad222b2b43b053d0128ded4bc, type: 3}
  - nomeQuemFala: Narrator
    texto: "But ambition changed everything. During a major breakthrough, P\xE9res
      presented the entire project to their superior as his own, erasing Myke\u2019s
      name from history."
    imagemFundo: {fileID: 3733806953780483782, guid: a718a6b93f44b584fb8c7a8550969d25, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e1e8e5ad222b2b43b053d0128ded4bc, type: 3}
  - nomeQuemFala: Myke
    texto: What are you doing?! That was OUR project! You stole everything I worked
      for!
    imagemFundo: {fileID: 8960213033406119914, guid: 4d038ccdd0ca6bc4dad9a730f3bae6f0, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01e71ceb9b67c924cb514d5d7286791d, type: 3}
  - nomeQuemFala: "P\xE9res"
    texto: "Face reality, Myke. The board needs a leader, not a sidekick. You\u2019re
      out."
    imagemFundo: {fileID: -8008447450637822732, guid: fd57f2906efba3a40969e030696c291f, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3cc2f7f0224b35f44a9d36b946c2d7da, type: 3}
  - nomeQuemFala: Narrator
    texto: The argument escalated into a physical fight. As a consequence, Myke was
      demoted, stripped of his authority, and pushed to the background.
    imagemFundo: {fileID: 5074354084149328108, guid: 182cc2fe6710ccf46bf2a05c1e14fdd9, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e1e8e5ad222b2b43b053d0128ded4bc, type: 3}
  - nomeQuemFala: Narrator
    texto: He became a ghost in his own workplace... until a breaking news report
      shook the scientific world.
    imagemFundo: {fileID: -957462911366893695, guid: 5c3751b85c70dde44b46dcfef5310465, type: 3}
    somFala: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e1e8e5ad222b2b43b053d0128ded4bc, type: 3}
